<LegalLayout
  title="Delete your account — Fluo"
  description="How to delete your LinguaLoop account and associated data, or request deletion by email."
  pageTitle="Delete your LinguaLoop account"
>
  <p>You can delete your LinguaLoop account and associated data at any time, either from inside the app or by email.</p>

  <h2 id="delete-in-app">1. Delete from inside the app (preferred)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open LinguaLoop on your device.</li>
    <li>Go to <strong>Profile → Settings → Manage account</strong>.</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Delete account</strong>.</li>
    <li>Confirm. Your account and all associated data will be permanently deleted within 30 days.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="delete-by-email">2. Delete by email (alternative)</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If you can't access the app, send an email to <a href="mailto:contact@linguatech.app">contact@linguatech.app</a> from the email address associated with your LinguaLoop account.</li>
    <li>Subject: <strong>"Delete my account"</strong>.</li>
    <li>We will verify ownership and process the deletion within 30 days.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="what-deleted">3. What gets deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>User profile (name, email, native language, target level, preferences).</li>
    <li>Learning progress (completed lessons, exercise history, streaks, stats).</li>
    <li>Saved phrases, chat history, and Speaking session transcripts.</li>
    <li>Reminder configuration and notification preferences.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="what-retained">4. What is retained</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Anonymized analytics events used for product improvement (cannot be linked back to the deleted account).</li>
    <li>Billing/transaction records required by tax and consumer protection law in the user's jurisdiction (retained for the legally mandated period, after which they are also deleted).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="subscription-cancellation">5. Subscription cancellation</h2>
  <p>Deleting your account does <strong>NOT</strong> cancel active subscriptions. You must cancel your subscription separately through Google Play before deleting your account, otherwise you'll continue to be charged.</p>
  <p>Open the Google Play app → <strong>Profile → Payments &amp; subscriptions → Subscriptions → LinguaLoop → Cancel subscription</strong>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
